    "comment": "Distance: 1650 Conditions: Slight and variable headwind, tail current, and light rain. Floating starts, so times should not be compared across races. Comments: The G1 race was a dead heat! Andover had a small lead with ~10 strokes to go and caught a crab. The final result was too close to call. \r\nThe G4 race had an oar come out in the first 30s, and was restarted at ~200m in. \r\n\r\nCongratulations to Andover for winning the David Swift Trophy, for combined boys and girls points (Andover 36, Exeter 34, Tabor 7). \r\n\r\nThank you to all crews for a great day of racing!\r\n\nNone",
